= Siegfried Auberon

Auberon is a leader of the Ledger League, the federation of <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformist</span> white-collar Free Guilds.

- @white_collar
- @union_unity
- @crisis
- @moderate_economic_plan
- @root: Return to main

@white_collar
title: Organizing white-collar workers
subtitle: Improve our standing among the new middle class.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; burgher_marcher += 6*(1-dissent);

We have increased our organizing among white-collar workers.

@union_unity
title: Free Guild-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the Free Guilds.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 10;

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction.

@crisis
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Auberon can help support a left-wing economic program.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and nationalization_adopted == 0 and veran_crash_seen == 1 and nationalization_support <= 5
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if veran_crash_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if nationalization_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Left plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; 
go-to: crisis_program.support_left 

@moderate_economic_plan
title: Support the reformist economic plan
subtitle: Auberon can also support a moderate economic plan.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and moderate_plan_adopted = 0 and veran_crash_seen = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if moderate_economic_plan = 0 : We have already adopted the reformist economic plan. ?] [? if veran_crash_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: crisis_program.support_moderate

